#ASSERT (`s 241(8)(b)(ii) the person making the offer has given the document with an option to return those securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` (Date 6 3 2026) FALSE (Date 10 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 241(8)(b)(iii): arguments: the date of lodgment; the person treats the issue as void; paid all moneys; the date paid
#ASSERT (`s 241(8)(b)(iii) the person making the offer has treated the issue as void and paid all moneys` (Date 6 3 2026) TRUE TRUE (Date 13 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
